Value SLOT (\S+)
Value CARD_TYPE (\S+)
Value ADMIN_STATE (\S+)
Value OPER_STATE (\S+)
Value COMMENTS (\S+)

Start
  ^Card\s+Summary
  ^=+
  ^Slot\s
  ^\s+Equipped
  ^-+
  ^${SLOT}\s+${CARD_TYPE}\s+${ADMIN_STATE}\s+${OPER_STATE}\s+${COMMENTS}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${SLOT}\s+${CARD_TYPE}\s+${ADMIN_STATE}\s+${OPER_STATE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
